  "title": "Best Penne alla Vodka",
  "description": "This easy penne alla vodka recipe tosses tender penne pasta and Italian sausage in a silky and deliciously creamy tomato and vodka sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
